      "id": "notre-dame-de-paris-s053-p02799",
      "source_en": "Finally, he made his appearance for the third time upon the summit of the tower where hung the great bell; from that point he seemed to be showing to the entire city the girl whom he had saved, and his voice of thunder, that voice which was so rarely heard, and which he never heard himself, repeated thrice with frenzy, even to the clouds: \"Sanctuary! Sanctuary! Sanctuary!\"",
